{"last_link_id": 44, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["| Speaker / 讲述者 | Voice Description / 声音描述 | Native Language / 母语 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Vivian** | Bright, slightly edgy young female voice.<br>明亮、略显犀利的年轻女性声音。 | Chinese / 中文 |\n| **Serena** | Warm, gentle young female voice.<br>温暖、温柔的年轻女性声音。 | Chinese / 中文 |\n| **Uncle_Fu** | Seasoned male voice with a low, mellow timbre.<br>低沉、醇厚、富有阅历的男性声音。 | Chinese / 中文 |\n| **Dylan** | Youthful Beijing male voice with a clear, natural timbre.<br>音色清脆、自然的北京年轻男性声音。 | Chinese (Beijing Dialect) / 中文（北京话） |\n| **Eric** | Lively Chengdu male voice with a slightly husky brightness.<br>活泼、略带沙哑感但不失明亮的成都男性声音。 | Chinese (Sichuan Dialect) / 中文（四川话） |\n| **Ryan** | Dynamic male voice with strong rhythmic drive.<br>富有动感、节奏感强的男性声音。 | English / 英语 |\n| **Aiden** | Sunny American male voice with a clear midrange.<br>阳光、中音清晰的美式男性声音。 | English / 英语 |\n| **Ono_Anna** | Playful Japanese female voice with a light, nimble timbre.<br>俏皮、音色轻盈灵动的日语女性声音。 | Japanese / 日语 |\n| **Sohee** | Warm Korean female voice with rich emotion.<br>情感丰富、温暖的韩语女性声音。 | Korean / 韩语 |"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "音色说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [620, 410], "pos": [230, 2620], "id": 23, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 37, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveAudio", "mode": 2, "bgcolor": "#355", "s